0..78 Comment "//! A sealed atom whose type member states an identity system: a relation, its"
79..156 Comment "//! reflexivity and the transport law contracting the singleton of each point"
157..236 Comment "//! onto its reflexivity. The relation is then the atom\'s identity type, so its"
237..291 Comment "//! evidence between two points is a path between them"
292..369 Comment "//! [Program-2013-homotopy_type_theory_univalent_foundations_mathematics], §"
370..393 Comment "//! 5.8, Theorem 5.8.2."
